<title>HONG KONG: Herald Holdings interim net up 8.0 pct.</title>
<headline>Herald Holdings interim net up 8.0 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended September 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   1.07    vs  0.98</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    1.0     vs  nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil     vs  nil</p>
<p>    Net			    6.52    vs  6.01</p>
<p>    Turnover		     521.57  vs  628.14</p>
<p>    Company name		 Herald Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  December 18-19, 1996</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   January 6, 1997</p>
<p>NOTE - Herald Holdings is a holding company with interests in toy manufacturing, aluminium, houseware and computer magnetic heads.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
